## Why This Is Asked
Testing event-driven flows requires more than unit tests; this checks end-to-end coverage, idempotency, and fault handling in CI.

## Key Concepts
- Event correctness across services
- Idempotent handlers and deduping
- Ordering Guarantees and retries
- Fault injection in CI and observability

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-idempotent handler
function handleOrderPlaced(event, state) {
  const key = event.orderId;
  if (state.processed.has(key)) return;
  // apply updates
  state.processed.add(key);
}
```

